                            "elements": [
                                {
                                    "id": "varbc",
                                    "elType": "widget",
                                    "widgetType": "text-editor",
                                    "settings": {
                                        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3D4F66;\"><a href=\"https://dev.biopentra.eu/\" style=\"color:#1F5FAE;text-decoration:none;\">Home</a> &gt; Resources &gt; Product Variations &amp; Concentrations</p>",
                                        "text_color": "#3D4F66"
                                    },
                                    "elements": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "varH1",
                                    "elType": "widget",
                                    "widgetType": "heading",
                                    "settings": {
                                        "header_size": "h1",
                                        "title": "Product Variations & Concentrations",
                                        "title_color": "#0F1F33"
                                    },
                                    "elements": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "varintro",
                                    "elType": "widget",
                                    "widgetType": "text-editor",
                                    "settings": {
                                        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3D4F66;\">Research products are often listed in more than one strength or concentration. Product variations exist so laboratories can choose a catalog option that matches how materials are organized in an inventory, how orders are reconciled, and how related compounds are compared in documentation.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3D4F66;\">On BioPentra, many peptide listings use WooCommerce variable products: a single product page with selectors for strength or similar attributes. This structure keeps related research compounds grouped while still tracking stock, SKU, and pricing at the variation level.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3D4F66;\">This page explains product variations and research product concentrations in plain language. It is an informational guide for laboratory research contexts\u2014not a protocol, dosage reference, or use instruction.</p>",
                                        "text_color": "#3D4F66"
                                    },
                                    "elements": []
                                }
                            ],
                            "isInner": true
                        }
                    ],
                    "isInner": true
                },
                {
